{"kaodian":[{"id":"L3-K01","desc":"五大產業配對：農業、漁業、畜牧業、工業、服務業與職業或產品對應，重點在判斷工作行為（種植/捕撈/畜養/加工/服務）而非原料"},{"id":"L3-K02","desc":"職業工作內容辨識：特定職業與其工作行為的正確配對，考古高頻職業包含醫生、藥師、農夫、果農、家具師傅、律師、美髮師、廚師、司機"},{"id":"L3-K03","desc":"各行各業互相依存：職業間分工合作讓生活更便利，供應鏈情境（午餐、課本、看病）追蹤多個職業角色"},{"id":"L3-K04","desc":"服務業辨識：廚師提供餐飲、司機提供運輸、老師提供教育等均屬服務業，與工業加工製造區分"},{"id":"L3-K05","desc":"選擇職業的考量：合宜考量為興趣、能力、專長；「缺點」或「外表光鮮」為常見誘答"},{"id":"L3-K06","desc":"課本的誕生：編寫→編輯校對→美編設計→印刷→裝訂→運送→販售等供應鏈各環節職業分工"},{"id":"L3-K07","desc":"尊重各行各業：職業無高低之分，各職業對社會都有貢獻，彼此互相需要"},{"id":"L3-K08","desc":"生活情境分工合作：從早餐、班刊、夜市等日常情境追蹤分工合作的概念"}],"results":[{"idx":0,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K02"},{"idx":1,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K02"},{"idx":2,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K04"},{"idx":3,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K02"},{"idx":4,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K06"},{"idx":5,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K06"},{"idx":6,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K06"},{"idx":7,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K06"},{"idx":8,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K06"},{"idx":9,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K06"},{"idx":10,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K06"},{"idx":11,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K02"},{"idx":12,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K02"},{"idx":13,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K02"},{"idx":14,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K02"},{"idx":15,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K02"},{"idx":16,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K02"},{"idx":17,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K02"},{"idx":18,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K02"},{"idx":19,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K02"},{"idx":20,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K03"},{"idx":21,"match":false,"kaodian_id":null},{"idx":22,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K01"},{"idx":23,"match":false,"kaodian_id":null},{"idx":24,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K07"},{"idx":25,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K01"},{"idx":26,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K03"},{"idx":27,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K03"},{"idx":28,"match":false,"kaodian_id":null},{"idx":29,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K02"},{"idx":30,"match":true,"kaodian_id":"L3-K02"},{"idx":